cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RuleAudit, please cite the software using this metadata."
title: "RuleAudit: Outcome-Free Structural Screening for Deterministic Additive Clinical Scores"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sour
    given-names: Behnam
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3176-1956"
    affiliation: "Bone and Joint Reconstruction Research Center, Shafa Yahyaeian Orthopedic Hospital, Iran University of Medical Sciences, Tehran, Iran"
version: 0.2.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sourbehnam1374-beep/ruleaudit"
url: "https://github.com/sourbehnam1374-beep/ruleaudit"
abstract: >-
  Alpha-stage research software for descriptive structural screening of
  deterministic additive clinical scores under user-specified synthetic input
  distributions. The software does not establish predictive accuracy,
  causality, clinical validity, transportability, or safety.
keywords:
  - clinical decision rules
  - structural screening
  - sensitivity analysis
  - synthetic data
  - reproducibility
